 gobuster is an aggresive enumerator that brute forces directories (dir), vhost, and domain name systems (dns).
~ gobuster [mode] [flag(s)]

MODES:
 dir - directory enumeration
 vhost - vhost enumeration
 dns - dns enumeration
FLAGS:
 -u -- URL (dir mode)
 -w -- wordlist path
 -x -- enumerates for extensions for potentially more results. example: '-x php,txt'
~  gobuster dir -u https://example.com -w /wordlists/Discovery/Web-Content/common.txt -- this enumerates directory of the website "example.com" using the wordlist from /wordlists/Discovery/Web-Content/common.txt
